      "font": "Arial",
      "flags": 0,
      "color": 0
    },
    {
      "page_index": 8,
      "text": "The error won’t affect Ethernet operation, since cable diagnostic (polarity detection) and correction are",
      "bbox": [
        85.10399627685547,
        748.7861938476562,
        539.2888793945312,
        759.8916015625
      ],
